Modified slightly for 3-Lib distribution, to fix 3 bugs and allow
SSD installation ....

.OPA file now distributed, for convenience, as the original code
had to have a specific disk drive hard-coded in ....
------------------------------------------------------------------

  This is Pipe3a for the psion 3a
 - Let's build a long pipeline - 

The goal of the game is to connect as many pieces of pipe as
possible together to a pipeline where a liquid flows through.
Pipe3a is the same (more or less) as xpipe for X11, although
I didn't used anything from the xpipe source.

[This is a "source only" distribution.]
The game requires about
10k of disk space and 35k of memory to run.

Original source code included, to be faithful to original distribution.
Install by putting the .OPA into \APP\ on any drive and by putting the two
.PIC files into \PIC\ on the same drive.

